---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure & Editorial Ethics"
  description="Read our full FTC affiliate disclosure and learn how Productivity Software Reviews funds its editorial work while keeping reviews transparent and independent."
>
  <div class="prose-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="badge">Transparency &amp; Ethics</span>
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Clear, upfront disclosure on how we fund our editorial research and reviews without compromising our independence.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="prose-section">
      <div class="card callout-card">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
          <strong>Summary (FTC Compliance):</strong> Productivity Software Reviews participates in affiliate partner programs with several SaaS providers. When you click on certain links on our site and purchase a paid subscription, we may earn a referral commission at <strong>zero extra cost to you</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>How Affiliate Links Support Our Work</h2>
      <p>
        Producing thorough software guides—exploring free plans and trials, auditing official documentation and pricing tiers, analyzing aggregated user feedback, and keeping comparisons up to date—takes ongoing time and effort. Rather than cluttering our pages with intrusive display ads or charging readers a subscription fee, we fund our work primarily through reader referrals.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you click a link to a software tool in one of our comparison tables or verdict boxes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>The price you pay never increases.</strong> You pay the exact same price (or receive a partner discount) as if you typed the vendor's URL directly into your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Commissions come from the vendor's marketing budget,</strong> not from your invoice.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Form Our Editorial Verdicts</h2>
      <p>
        Our reviews are based on hands-on time with free plans and trials, official documentation and pricing, and aggregated user feedback. To protect reader trust, the Productivity Software Reviews editorial team follows three strict rules:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong>Compensation Never Dictates Verdicts:</strong> We regularly highlight free tiers, open-source tools, and SaaS products that have no affiliate program whenever they are a strong fit for small businesses.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>No Sponsored Ratings:</strong> Software companies cannot pay us to write a favorable review, remove a limitation from a Pros &amp; Cons box, or alter their Editorial Score in our comparison tables.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Clear Labeling:</strong> Every review article features a prominent disclosure notice right above the main content before you click any outbound link.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>
        If you ever have questions about our review methodology or how a specific tool was evaluated, please reach out to our editorial team on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header h1 {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .callout-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-accent-subtle);
    border-color: #A7F3D0;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
